From 0fd83f769c2798e6917f7ef86178722bca477f02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael McAllister <me@michaelmcallister.org>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:39:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] archive: support initramfs overlays on a stock vendor ramdisk

A vendor ramdisk may populate lib/modules before the distribution
initramfs is unpacked. Linux cannot replace a populated directory with
a usr-merge symlink, leaving the dynamic loader unavailable at /lib.

When deviceinfo_bootimg_preserve_vendor_boot is enabled, materialize the
usr-merge directory aliases in both initramfs archives. Keep the default
archive layout unchanged for other devices.

Assisted-by: LLM
